      <h2 class="section-title section-title reveal-letters">Fire Protection Services &amp; Solutions for Australian Businesses</h2>
      <p class="section-text" data-aos="fade-up">
        Fire safety is not something a business should think about only when an alarm sounds. It begins much
        earlier. In the inspection. In the maintenance record. In the fire door that closes properly. In the
        extinguisher that is serviced. In the penetration that has been sealed correctly. In the hydrant that
